<BaseLayout
  title="About DINWEY"
  description="DINWEY is the truck and heavy-duty starting battery brand of Chengguang Energy, a manufacturer founded in 2002 in Hebei, China. OEM and private label manufacturing."
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1 style="color:#0f1f3d;">About DINWEY</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      DINWEY is the truck and heavy-duty starting battery brand of Chengguang Energy,
      a manufacturer founded in 2002. We focus on one thing: starting batteries that hold up
      under the demands of commercial trucks — high cold cranking amps, vibration resistance,
      and consistent batch quality.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:32px;">Our Focus</h2>
    <p>
      While many battery suppliers sell a broad catalog, DINWEY concentrates on the truck and
      heavy-duty vertical. That focus lets us go deep on what matters to commercial-vehicle
      buyers: correct group sizes (BCI Group 31, 8D, 4D; DIN H8/H9), diesel-grade CCA, and
      12V vs 24V system requirements.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:32px;">The Factory Behind the Brand</h2>
    <p>
      DINWEY is manufactured by Chengguang Energy, a battery manufacturer established in 2002
      in Jinzhou City, Shijiazhuang, Hebei Province, China. We support OEM and private label
      programs for distributors, importers and brands worldwide.
    </p>
    <p class="data-note">
      Certification details are available on request. Contact us for current certificates
      relevant to your market.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:32px;">What Our Partners Value</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
      Typical feedback from our partners, anonymized to protect their business identity.
    </p>
    <div class="testimonial">
      <blockquote>
        "Middle East distributors consistently highlight batch-to-batch consistency — every
        delivery ships with CCA test data and full documentation."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="attribution">— Distributor partner (anonymized)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonial">
